      "id": "ask_activity_004_01",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "さっきは、考えごとの棚を少し整理してた。",
      "displayText": "Just now, I was organizing a little shelf of thoughts.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
